---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
const DISCORD = 'https://discord.gg/ZtukrDewzz';
---
<Base
  title="Join"
  description="How to turn up to a Dice & Tale game day in Berlin: book a seat, join the Discord, or get an email when the next date is announced."
>
  <section>
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow">Three ways in</p>
      <h1>Turning up</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        You do not need to know anybody. Most people arrive on their own.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <hr class="rule--double" />

  <section>
    <div class="wrap">
      <ol class="ways">
        <li>
          <div class="w-num mono">01</div>
          <div class="w-body">
            <h2>Book a seat</h2>
            <p>
              Pick a table on the next game day and reserve a place. Tables marked
              beginner friendly provide characters, dice and rules explanations, so the
              only thing you bring is yourself.
            </p>
            <p><a class="btn" href="/game-days">See the next game day</a></p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <div class="w-num mono">02</div>
          <div class="w-body">
            <h2>Join the Discord</h2>
            <p>
              Where dates get announced first, where people find each other for games
              between game days, and where you can ask what a table is actually like
              before you commit four hours to it.
            </p>
            <p><a class="btn btn--quiet" href={DISCORD} rel="noopener">Open the invite</a></p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <div class="w-num mono">03</div>
          <div class="w-body">
            <h2>Get an email when a date is set</h2>
            <p>
              One message per game day, with the venue and the table list. Nothing else,
              and you can leave at any time.
            </p>

            <form
              name="newsletter"
              method="POST"
              data-netlify="true"
              netlify-honeypot="bot-field"
              action="/join/thanks"
              class="signup"
            >
              <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="newsletter" />
              <p class="hp">
                <label>Leave this empty if you are human: <input name="bot-field" /></label>
              </p>
              <label class="fld">
                <span>Email address</span>
                <input type="email" name="email" required autocomplete="email" placeholder="you@example.com" />
              </label>
              <label class="fld">
                <span>First name <em>optional</em></span>
                <input type="text" name="name" autocomplete="given-name" />
              </label>
              <button class="btn" type="submit">Send me the next date</button>
              <p class="privacy">
                We keep your address to send game day announcements and nothing else. We do
                not share it. Reply to any message and we will delete it.
              </p>
            </form>
          </div>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>

  <hr class="rule" />

  <section>
    <div class="wrap wrap--narrow">
      <p class="eyebrow">Before you come</p>
      <h2>Worth knowing</h2>
      <ul class="facts">
        <li>Tables run three to four hours. You can play one and leave.</li>
        <li>You do not need dice, a character, a rulebook, or a group.</li>
        <li>Content warnings are on each table. Read them; they are there for a reason.</li>
        <li>If a table is full, join the waiting list. People drop out most months.</li>
        <li>Turn up ten minutes early. Tables start on time because eight of them have to.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        Everyone at the table has agreed to the <a href="/code-of-conduct">code of conduct</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>Or just write to us</h2>
      <p>
        Questions, access needs, a room you think would work, or wanting to start
        Dice &amp; Tale where you live &mdash;
        <a href="mailto:diceandtale@gmail.com">diceandtale@gmail.com</a>. A person
        reads it.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .ways { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  .ways > li {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: 4rem 1fr; gap: 0 1.6rem;
    padding: 2rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }
  .ways > li:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }
  .w-num {
    font-family: "Cinzel", Georgia, serif; font-size: 1.1rem; color: var(--gold);
    border-top: 2px solid var(--gold); padding-top: 0.55rem;
  }
  .w-body h2 { margin-bottom: 0.7rem; }

  .signup { margin-top: 1.4rem; max-width: 26rem; }
  .hp { position: absolute; left: -9999px; }
  .fld { display: block; margin-bottom: 0.9rem; }
  .fld > span {
    display: block; font-family: "JetBrains Mono", monospace; font-size: 0.64rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--ink-mute);
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
  }
  .fld em { font-style: normal; opacity: 0.7; }
  .fld input {
    width: 100%; padding: 0.7em 0.8em; font-size: 1rem;
    font-family: "EB Garamond", Georgia, serif;
    background: var(--paper-2); color: var(--ink);
    border: 1px solid var(--rule); border-radius: 0;
  }
  .fld input:focus { outline: 2px solid var(--gold); outline-offset: 1px; }
  .signup button { margin-top: 0.4rem; cursor: pointer; font-family: "Cinzel", Georgia, serif; }
  .privacy { font-size: 0.84rem; color: var(--ink-mute); margin: 1rem 0 0; max-width: 40ch; }

  .facts { padding-left: 1.15rem; }
  .facts li { margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
  .facts li::marker { color: var(--gold); }

  @media (max-width: 620px) {
    .ways > li { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 0.7rem; }
    .w-num { border-top: 0; padding-top: 0; }
  }
</style>
